flowchart TB
    Data[data/]
    DB[searchcraft.sqlite]
    WAL[SQLite WAL and shared memory files]
    Indexes[indexes/]
    Named[<index-name>/]
    Manifest[manifest.json]
    Generations[generations/]
    Generation[generation-N.json]
    Staging[staging/ planned]
    Snapshots[snapshots/ planned]

    Data --> DB
    Data --> WAL
    Data --> Indexes
    Indexes --> Named
    Named --> Manifest
    Named --> Generations
    Generations --> Generation
    Named -. future .-> Staging
    Named -. future .-> Snapshots
